  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please add the ability to choose which random portals and teleport effects are included in the rotation. Right now, when “Random” is selected, it can choose the default portal or effects that some players may not like. It would be much better if we could toggle specific portals and effects on or off so only our preferred ones are used.\n\nalso Let players separately choose their entrance teleport animation and exit teleport animation. This would allow for mix-and-match combinations, such as teleporting in with one effect and leaving with a flower animation.",
